      "id": "I_kwDODjvEJM7l8J6d",
      "title": "Remove IFaultDisputeGame dependency from AnchorStateRegistry",
      "author": "ajsutton",
      "number": 18943,
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/optimism",
      "body": "The `AnchorStateRegistry` currently assumes games implement the `IFaultDisputeGame` interface. With interop (and ZK) this is no longer true.  We should ensure `AnchorStateRegistry` only uses `IDisputeGame`. We can add additional methods to `IDisputeGame` if needed but should review to ensure they really are necessary.",
