    {
      "id": "PR_kwDODjvEJM69q-bl",
      "title": "feat(op-hardforks): migrate op-hardforks to the monorepo",
      "author": "theochap",
      "number": 18825,
      "body": "## Description\r\n\r\nMigrate `op-hardforks` out of the `alloy-rs/hardforks` into the optimism monorepo\r\n\r\n## Git commands used\r\n\r\nRewrite commit history\r\n```\r\ncd /tmp/hardforks-migration && git filter-repo \\                                                                                            \r\n     --path crates/op-hardforks \\                                                                                                              \r\n     --message-callback '                                                                                                                      \r\n   import re                                                                                                                                   \r\n   # Replace (#XX) with (alloy-rs/hardforks#XX)                                                                                                \r\n   return re.sub(rb\"\\(#(\\d+)\\)\", rb\"(alloy-rs/hardforks#\\1)\", message)                                                                         \r\n   ' \r\n```\r\n\r\nFilter history\r\n```\r\ngit filter-repo --subdirectory-filter crates/op-hardforks \r\n```\r\n\r\nAdd the git subtree:\r\n```\r\ngit subtree add /tmp/op-hardforks theo/move-alloy-hardforks --prefix op-hardforks\r\n```",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/optimism",
      "createdAt": "2026-01-16T17:59:38Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-01-26T21:48:14Z",
      "additions": 2001,
      "deletions": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDODjvEJM6_CXfZ",
      "title": "fix: better retries and caching for superchain registry",
      "author": "smartcontracts",
      "number": 18933,
      "body": "Introduces better timeout, retry, and caching for the superchain registry code for grabbing historical OPCM versions. Avoids CI flakes.\r\n\r\nClaude wrote most of this\r\n",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/optimism",
      "createdAt": "2026-01-23T22:09:48Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-01-26T22:34:26Z",
      "additions": 760,
      "deletions": 73
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDODjvEJM6_aYAs",
      "title": "op-proposer: Support fetching proposals via supernode rpc",
      "author": "Inphi",
      "number": 18940,
      "body": "For the time being, the supernode RPC is only configurable programmatically. This the minimum required for devstack.\r\n\r\nAdding support for supernode RPC via cli will be done at a later date once supernode is production ready for interop proofs.\r\n\r\nfixes https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/optimism/issues/18920",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/optimism",
      "createdAt": "2026-01-26T17:15:56Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-01-27T01:17:55Z",
